{"id":"c78f3207eb79266e","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-consistency-by-cut-elimination.md","title":"由切消导出一致性的证据条件","display":"df-consistency-by-cut-elimination — 由切消导出一致性的证据条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-consistency-by-cut-elimination","aliases":["18-df-consistency-by-cut-elimination","18-df-038"],"display":"df-consistency-by-cut-elimination — 由切消导出一致性的证据条件","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-tree]]","[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]","[[18-df-cut-elimination-property]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-consistency-by-cut-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-consistency-by-cut-elimination</span><span>18-df-038</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-by-cut-elimination — 由切消导出一致性的证据条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"570d01ae273edcd2\" href=\"?note=570d01ae273edcd2\" title=\"18-df-proof-cut-rank\">18-df-proof-cut-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25483faf64333446\" href=\"?note=25483faf64333446\" title=\"18-df-cut-elimination-property\">18-df-cut-elimination-property</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a> 的双边规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>；空相继式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle\">\\(e=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutElimination}\">\\(\\mathrm{CutElimination}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{CutFree}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25483faf64333446\" href=\"?note=25483faf64333446\" title=\"18-df-cut-elimination-property\">18-df-cut-elimination-property</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"570d01ae273edcd2\" href=\"?note=570d01ae273edcd2\" title=\"18-df-proof-cut-rank\">18-df-proof-cut-rank</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 为上游谓词；本节引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal T\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal T\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)\\to\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal T\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\n\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)\\to\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal T\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\n\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第二式由第一式直接推出：假设空相继式有证明，切消给出其无切证明，违反另一条件。修正旧稿把尚未定义的 PA 双边演算当成既定对象的做法。原书 NT 的一致性实际用单边半形式系统和空公式集，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a44f2e4245074d4a\" href=\"?note=a44f2e4245074d4a\" title=\"18-thm-gentzen\">18-thm-gentzen</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-cut-rank","status":"resolved","id":"570d01ae273edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-cut-elimination-property","status":"resolved","id":"25483faf64333446","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-cut-elimination-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的双边规则集 $\\mathcal P$；空相继式是 $e=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{CutElimination}$ 与 $\\mathrm{CutFree}$ 见 [[18-df-cut-elimination-property]]、[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-cut-elimination-property","status":"resolved","id":"25483faf64333446","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的双边规则集 $\\mathcal P$；空相继式是 $e=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{CutElimination}$ 与 $\\mathrm{CutFree}$ 见 [[18-df-cut-elimination-property]]、[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-cut-rank","status":"resolved","id":"570d01ae273edcd2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的双边规则集 $\\mathcal P$；空相继式是 $e=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{CutElimination}$ 与 $\\mathrm{CutFree}$ 见 [[18-df-cut-elimination-property]]、[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-gentzen","status":"resolved","id":"a44f2e4245074d4a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"第二式由第一式直接推出：假设空相继式有证明，切消给出其无切证明，违反另一条件。修正旧稿把尚未定义的 PA 双边演算当成既定对象的做法。原书 NT 的一致性实际用单边半形式系统和空公式集，见 [[18-thm-gentzen]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"e=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutElimination}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal T\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\n\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsistencyByCutElim}(\\mathcal P)\\to\n\\neg\\exists\\mathcal T\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\n\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T})=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle).","display":true}],"bytes":1704,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323